{"title":"Baby Red Dragon","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 55 Dragon that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (1.3% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: breath: {\n            shape: {\n                kind: \"cone\",\n                rangeTiles: 4,\n                halfAngle: De\n            },\n            inhaleMs: 1e3,\n            cooldownMs: 12e3,\n            damageMult: 1\n        }</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/ember-gland\">Ember Gland</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=54\">Lv 54 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=56\">Lv 56 <span>7</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=57\">Lv 57 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=54\" title=\"Pick level 54\"><td><b>54</b></td><td>358</td><td>34.2</td><td>2,700</td><td class=\"muted\">1,074 · 47.9 · 8,100</td><td>3</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=55\" title=\"Pick level 55\"><td><b>55</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>374</td><td>34.8</td><td>2,750</td><td class=\"muted\">1,122 · 48.7 · 8,250</td><td>2</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ashreach\">Ashreach</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=56\" title=\"Pick level 56\"><td><b>56</b></td><td>389</td><td>35.3</td><td>2,800</td><td class=\"muted\">1,167 · 49.4 · 8,400</td><td>7</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ashreach\">Ashreach</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>57</b></td><td>406</td><td>35.9</td><td>2,850</td><td class=\"muted\">1,218 · 50.3 · 8,550</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"baby-red-dragon\" data-map-level=\"57\">Show level 57 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 18 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 18 looted corpses, 18 recorded drops, 102 total, 2–10 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/18</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonscale-knick\" title=\"Dragonscale Knick - in 100% of 18 looted corpses, 18 recorded drops, 18 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/620b30f073ef24409e0d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonscale Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 18/18</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragon-hide\" title=\"Dragon Hide - in 100% of 18 looted corpses, 18 recorded drops, 18 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9e2b88dfaf721a2d79c9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragon Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 18/18</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragon-fang\" title=\"Dragon Fang - in 50% of 18 looted corpses, 9 recorded drops, 20 total, 1–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2688ac9988cad641486e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragon Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 9/18</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"tome-tailoring-dragonscale\" title=\"Tome Tailoring Dragonscale - in 6% of 18 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b07ca7bf7da10e5b278c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Tome Tailoring Dragonscale</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6% · 1/18</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 2094, 331 <span class=\"muted\">· 33 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2126, 394 <span class=\"muted\">· 21 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 19 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ashreach\">Ashreach</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 10 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2190, 432 <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2023, 258 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Storm-Buried%20Caravan\">Storm-Buried Caravan</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"baby-red-dragon\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Dragon: <a href=\"#/monster/young-red-dragon\">Young Red Dragon</a> <span class=\"muted\">(62)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/red-dragon\">Red Dragon</a> <span class=\"muted\">(70)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/7aca051983df137719ab.webp\" alt=\"Baby Red Dragon\"></div><h3>Baby Red Dragon</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>57</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 55)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Dragon</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>406</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>35.9</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2,850</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.8</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (10 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>154 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}